        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako, mwana amuntu, sinsima akwaambila Gogo kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Mubuzuba obo, bantu bangu ba-Israyeli nebanooyookede caluumuno, uyoobuka, ",
