        },
        {
          "text": "Inswi zyamulwizi, abayuni bakujulu, abanyama bamusokwe, abauka boonse bayavula ansi, abantu boonse bakede anyika, boonse buyo bayookankama kubusyu bwangu. Azyalo zilundu ziyoomwayigwa, amandomba aakumajenga ayookolomoka, amalambo oonse ayoowida ansi. ",
