              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoomubeteka amalwazi abulowa. Njoomuwisizya imvula yamucobocobo acivulamabwe, mulilo asulufa, walo amakamu makamu aakwe abantu banji boonse mbali abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
